<section class="fpg-fo-sec" id="features"><div class="fpg-fo-wrap"><h2 class="fpg-fo-h2">How the ST8D is built</h2><ul class="fpg-fo-feats" role="list">
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip8.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip8.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip8.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>FörstGrip feed rollers</h3><p>Twin hydraulic rollers. The top one lifts on an arc and is held down by two heavy springs, so it climbs over butt ends and drags in forks and awkward limbs.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly8.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly8.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly8.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Open-top flywheel</h3><p>A 728 × 30 mm flywheel with twin 10-inch blades and rear draught fins throws the chip to the front of the truck, wet material included.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-doosan55.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-doosan55.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-doosan55.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>55hp Doosan diesel</h3><p>A 55hp Doosan DPF diesel that needs no AdBlue (DEF).</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>AutoIntelligence control</h3><p>Sealed electronics that run the no-stress feed, tell you when a service is due and prompt the routine checks. Proof against water and vibration.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-touch.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-touch.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-touch.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Touch-button feed</h3><p>Illuminated IP69-rated touch pads on both sides of the hopper, with a traditional feed bar as well.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-robust.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-robust.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-robust.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Built to last</h3><p>Heavy-gauge steel where it matters and extra support under the hopper.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-speed.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-speed.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-speed.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Variable roller speed</h3><p>Slow the feed for hardwood, speed it up for brash.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Easy-access anvil</h3><p>The anvil turns or swaps in minutes, so a fresh edge is never a workshop job.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank35.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank35.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank35.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Clear fuel tank</h3><p>A see-through 35-litre tank with a wide filler neck. You can read the level from across the yard.</p></div></li>
</ul></div></section>
